    <mxCell id="mw" value="MainWindow (Editor)

Fields (selected):
+_currentMap:MapDto?
+_currentMapPath:string?
+_undo:Stack&lt;IEditCommand&gt;
+_redo:Stack&lt;IEditCommand&gt;
