+_mode:EditMode

Key methods:
+ExecuteCommand(cmd)
+Undo()/Redo()
+PersistMap()
+SetLayerCell(kind,idx,val)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="40" y="120" width="420" height="330" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
